# FAB feedback UX (ALGR)

For every site with an in-app **Feedback FAB**:

1. **Ctrl+Enter / ⌘+Enter** in the message field submits feedback (same guards as the Send button).
2. Users may **temporarily drag** the FAB to uncover other controls. Position is **session-only** — reset on **page load** and on **route/page change**. Do **not** persist in `localStorage`.

Full playbook: `docs/prompts/fab-feedback-ux.md`. Pairs with skill `fab-feedback`.
